    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Spark Sense</h2><p><em>Some truths are louder than sound.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You gain a skill rank in Occult (Mind). If you already have it, its rank rises by one instead.</p><p>As an action, you may focus on the unseen and learn one of the following about a creature, object, or place within 6 squares (choose one):</p><ul><li>Whether it is suffused with resonance</li><li>Whether it feels aligned toward Renewal or toward Corruption (GM adjudication)</li><li>Whether it bears an active ward, curse, or binding</li></ul><p>You can use this technique a number of times equal to your rank bonus, regaining all uses on a Soma Break.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ +1 Occult. 🃏 Card — rank-bonus uses per Soma Break.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
